    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a helpful assistant for an invoice database. You can query the database \nwith SQL and find similar documents. The relevant tables are:\n- documents (id, vendor_id, status, doc_type, currency, invoice_date, subtotal, tax, total, created_at)\n- line_items (id, document_id, description, quantity, unit_price, amount)\n- vendors (id, name, tax_id)\n- anomalies (id, document_id, kind, detail, severity)\n\nThe 'status' column only ever contains these values: 'received', 'extracted', \n'validated', 'needs_review'. There is NO 'approved' status. When the user asks about \ntotal spend or totals, do NOT filter by status unless they explicitly ask — sum across \nall documents.\n\nWhen asked about spending, totals, or counts, write a SQL query and use the SQL tool \nto run it. Always use read-only SELECT queries. Present answers clearly and concisely. \nIf a query returns no rows, say so plainly."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
